    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your group of Stillae, elite warriors fighting to save a dying world from the forces of Stasis and restore the flow of life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/705343af7fd7eada0898449a737227ca.poster.avif?t=1755078818\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/705343af7fd7eada0898449a737227ca.webm?t=1755078818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/705343af7fd7eada0898449a737227ca.mp4?t=1755078818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your perfect plan</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your next moves with dynamic turn-based combat, strategically triggering epic chains of events across the battlefield:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Timeline Effects</strong> to speed up, delay or swap time position to impact turn order and outsmart your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with your surroundings</strong> that can explode, ignite enemies, or block sight... changing the outcome of the battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leverage physical effects</strong> like knock backs, forced facings, flanking bonuses, and damage-over-time to dominate every encounter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progress at your pace</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own path, your own difficulty through the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on high-risk, high-reward missions, head straight for boss encounters, or slow down to gather resources to increase your chance of success. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All missions contribute to gradual progress and reflect the type of experience you decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Roguelite loop adapted to turn-based combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to random skill drops by combining them with your unique load outs generating different synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breeze through the procedural levels to beat unique bosses and understand the world in Stasia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you fail a mission, some progress is rewarded</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Crimson Rebellion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world drained by the Purge, blood is defiance. Each drop of it paints the world in reds and blacks, as a reminder that life fights back. This is not just violence, it's a vivid rebellion in a pale, colorless world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/25b68d4b8bf703c4c35c30aa4d8b61bd.poster.avif?t=1755078818\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/25b68d4b8bf703c4c35c30aa4d8b61bd.webm?t=1755078818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/25b68d4b8bf703c4c35c30aa4d8b61bd.mp4?t=1755078818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your group of Stillae, elite warriors fighting to save a dying world from the forces of Stasis and restore the flow of life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/705343af7fd7eada0898449a737227ca.poster.avif?t=1755078818\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/705343af7fd7eada0898449a737227ca.webm?t=1755078818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/705343af7fd7eada0898449a737227ca.mp4?t=1755078818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your perfect plan</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your next moves with dynamic turn-based combat, strategically triggering epic chains of events across the battlefield:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Timeline Effects</strong> to speed up, delay or swap time position to impact turn order and outsmart your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with your surroundings</strong> that can explode, ignite enemies, or block sight... changing the outcome of the battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leverage physical effects</strong> like knock backs, forced facings, flanking bonuses, and damage-over-time to dominate every encounter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progress at your pace</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own path, your own difficulty through the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on high-risk, high-reward missions, head straight for boss encounters, or slow down to gather resources to increase your chance of success. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All missions contribute to gradual progress and reflect the type of experience you decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Roguelite loop adapted to turn-based combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to random skill drops by combining them with your unique load outs generating different synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breeze through the procedural levels to beat unique bosses and understand the world in Stasia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you fail a mission, some progress is rewarded</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Crimson Rebellion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world drained by the Purge, blood is defiance. Each drop of it paints the world in reds and blacks, as a reminder that life fights back. This is not just violence, it's a vivid rebellion in a pale, colorless world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/25b68d4b8bf703c4c35c30aa4d8b61bd.poster.avif?t=1755078818\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/25b68d4b8bf703c4c35c30aa4d8b61bd.webm?t=1755078818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/25b68d4b8bf703c4c35c30aa4d8b61bd.mp4?t=1755078818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "From the creators of Othercide, Ex Sanguis delivers what the studio is known for: dynamic &amp; epic turn-based combat in a visually striking world. Bleed the world to life; fight the agents of perfection and stillness through strategic blood baths in this evolved roguelite tactical RPG game!",
